#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Forma 3D is a WooCommerce theme for stores that show products as interactive 3D models. A scroll-animated homepage turns your featured products in real 3D, the shop has a 3D quick view, and product pages work with the free 3D Viewer plugin for rotate, zoom, dimensions and AR. Built for the block editor with theme.json colours, fonts and block patterns."
msgstr ""

